The authenticated application currently has too much branding and navigation occupying the available screen space.

Redesign the application header.

## Header structure

**Top left:**
- Display the TrustFlow logo only.
- Do not write "TrustFlow" beside the logo.
- The logo should be clickable and take the user back to the landing page.

**Top right:**
